link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ettvard_Needle\" title=\"Ettvard Needle\">Ettvard Needle</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a> publishing house.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Opens the metal door to the <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth_Basement\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth Basement\">Baldur's Mouth Basement</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>A copy of this key lies inside a locked <a href=\"/wiki/Document_Chest\" title=\"Document Chest\">Document Chest</a> in Ettvard's private office in the <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;64&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-60</span>. This item has UID S_LOW_BaldursMouth_BasementKey_002, UUID 71034255-45e1-470a-aafe-2d3c53d6c20a</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715061746\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1570/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25524/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5953/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936073/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.214      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.214      1 -total\n 47.59%   19.614      6 Template:Icon_text\n 42.95%   17.701     16 Template:Trim\n 21.62%    8.912      2 Template:Uid\n 16.60%    6.840      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.46%    5.959      1 Template:PageSe